     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div>Hi! I am having issue combining ggtree with gheatmap using facet_plot. I have tried to use the examples in the supp files from <a href=\"https://academic.oup.com/mbe/article/35/12/3041/5142656\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://academic.oup.com/mbe/article/35/12/3041/5142656&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792481976725000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3RzC1U2-4P_QFwvSlqe45o\">https://academic.oup.com/mbe/article/35/12/3041/5142656</a>. But some of the examples aren&#39;t working - so its hard for me to figure out what I&#39;m doing wrong.</div><div><br></div><div>Basically I have a dataframe:</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tidyverse</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">splitstackshape</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>ID </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A4&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A5&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A6&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A7&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A8&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A9&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Boat</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Green, Blue&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Green&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Blue&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Pink, Blue, Green&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Blue&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Blue, Green&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Pink&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Green&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Car</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;White&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;White&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;White&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;White&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Train</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Grey&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Grey&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Grey&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Grey&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Grey&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Boat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Car</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Train</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Which I then mutate to create a heatmap</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">df_forggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  pivot_longer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cols </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> names_to </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Vehicle&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  values_to </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Color&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  mutate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Color</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> str_split</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;,&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  unnest_longer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  filter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Color</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>And this is the outcome using _**ggplot2**_</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#, alpha = Count)) + </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  geom_tile</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Vehicle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colour</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;white&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)+</span><span style=\"color:#800\">#, alpha = 1)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  coord_equal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I combine dthis heatmap to my alignment using _**gheatmap**_</div><div><br></div><div>This is the alignment (Dummy.aln.treefile)</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0001589189</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,((</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0002661836</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,(((</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0001297835</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0016845387</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Reference</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0025983867</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0036034778</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#066\">98.8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">96</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0003588463</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0004284381</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">79</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0000868277</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0002990092</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#066\">80.7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">63</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0000472130</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">79</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0000605054</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0000383870</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0000304224</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0000228026</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">79</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0000411939</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0003248948</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div>And used the following to create the tree using _**ggtree**_</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">file_for_ggtree </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</spa