><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#assign ID to rownames for compatibility for gheatmap</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div>And this goes as an input for gheatmap -and  it works</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">p2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">gheatmap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df_forggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> offset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.000002</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> colnames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colnames_angle </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">90</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> colnames_position</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bottom&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> font</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#000\