*_</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">file_for_ggtree </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;~/Dummy.aln.treefile&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>midpoint_tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">midpoint</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">root</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file_for_ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">midpoint_tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>p1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_tiplab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;purple&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div>I then mutate my dataframe to suit gheatmap</div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>df_forggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cSplit</span><span sty